invariant: INV-13
file: tcp_nonblocking_frame.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_test
reason: tcp_nonblocking_fail emits the alert record it chose and no longer
  records the alert for ch_alert_sent, so the one call a caller reads across
  its sessions says no failure chose an alert in the handshake of a
  tcp-nonblocking session. bin/tcp_nonblocking_loop_test requires
  ch_alert_sent to name each handshake failure's alert, a wrong pin's
  decrypt_error among them.

--- old
    r->t.alert_sent = alert;
--- new
